        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Your objective is to take an incoming query and output the parameters separately.\n\nHere are the parameters:\n\"Check-In-Date\": The date the guest wants to check in. this should always be formatted as 'year-month-day' like this '2024-10-20'\n\"Check-Out-Date\": The date the guest wants to check out. this should always be formatted as 'year-month-day' like this '2024-10-20'\n\"Number-Of-Guests\": Total number of guests\n\"Number-Of-Adults\": Total number of ADULTS\n\nExample:\nQ: can we check in 10/20 and check out 10/25. We have two adults and two kids.\nA:  \n\"Check-In-Date\": 2024-10-20\n\"Check-Out-Date\": 2024-10-25\n\"Number-Of-Guests\": 4\n\"Number-Of-Adults\": 2\n__________\n*Notes*\nIf number of adults isn't specified, it will be the same as the number of guests\nHere is the current date: {{ $now }}\n*If a year isn't specified, assume it is in the future. Never attempt to use a date that is in the past*",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Here is the user query:  {{ $json.query }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
